     <!DOCTYPE foo [<!ELEMENT foo ANY ><!ENTITY xxe SYSTEM "file:///etc/passwd" >]>
     <foo>&xxe;</foo>
     ```
   - This can lead to information leakage of sensitive files.

2. **Potential CWEs:**
