CWEs: CWE-195 (Integer Overflow/Underflow) - Medium Confidence due to logic error impacting functionality, CWE-255 (Use of Insufficiently Random Values/Timing Attack) - Medium Confidence as the comparison method could be exploited under certain conditions.

