- CWE-400 (Uncontrolled Resource Consumption) - Medium Confidence (specific to ReDoS)
- CWE-306 (Missing Authentication for Critical Function) - High Confidence
- CWE-703 (Incorrect Error Handling) - Medium Confidence
- CWE-209 (Information Exposure) - Low Confidence

